wuxia-title = Wuxia
wuxia-description = Cultivators walk among the crew. Manuals of qi and the body lie hidden in the station, a legendary artifact waits to be claimed, and heaven itself is watching.
wuxia-ascension-title = Wuxia: Ascension
wuxia-ascension-description = Everyone aboard may take up cultivation. Race to the peak: the first to reach Nascent Soul or a Primordial Chaos Body becomes the Supreme Sovereign and has until the shuttle arrives to settle every score.
